Z||000012||Formula||07-24-2001||05:24 PM||||my old cradle had both, the lower control arm mount broke and the one tranny mount ripped... my U bracket that sits on top of the motor mount broke in half too.... gee, I wonder why my car idled so rough LOL... I replaced the whole cradle with the new motor and we welded the U bracket back together.  all three look to be fairly common to break.||||reg||1
